"""
Neo Geo CMC50 C-ROM and M1 transform helpers.

This module removes the runtime dependency on a separate neo-cmc executable.
It embeds the minimal MAME-derived CMC source needed by the extractor and builds
an internal helper executable on first use.

Important:
- This is not pure Python CMC logic; it is a self-contained internal helper.
- It requires a working C++17 compiler: g++ or clang++.
- The embedded CMC source carried BSD-3-Clause notices from MAME contributors
  S. Smith, David Haywood, and Fabio Priuli. Preserve those credits in the
  project NOTICE/credits.
"""

# Implementation notes:
# This module implements Neo Geo processing behaviour researched through
# public Neo Geo tooling, emulator documentation, and related extraction
# workflows.
#
# See README.md -> Credits and Acknowledgements for full project-wide credits.

